   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxCat1StartZone">
     <property name="title">
      <string>Category I start zone</string>
     </property>
     <property name="toolTip">
      <string>Category I casts rays parallel to the leg from the waypoint the ships come from.  Right after that waypoint the ships are still arriving from the previous leg, so an obstacle lying there would collect the tail of a distribution the ships never sail.  With this on, rays whose first edge crossing lies within the given share of the leg are ignored; the opposite direction's rays (which start at the far waypoint) and Category II are not affected.</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayoutCat1">
      <item>
       <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="horizontalLayoutCat1">
        <item>
         <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbCat1SkipStart">
          <property name="text">
           <string>Ignore Category I hits within the first</string>
          </property>
          <property name="checked">
           <bool>true</bool>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="sbCat1SkipStartPct">
          <property name="suffix">
           <string> % of the leg</string>
          </property>
          <property name="decimals">
           <number>1</number>
          </property>
          <property name="maximum">
           <double>90.000000000000000</double>
          </property>
          <property name="value">
           <double>10.000000000000000</double>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <spacer name="horizontalSpacerCat1">
          <property name="orientation">
           <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
          </property>
          <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
           <size>
            <width>10</width>
            <height>10</height>
           </size>
          </property>
         </spacer>
        </item>
       </layout>
      </item>
      <item>
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelCat1StartZoneHelp">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Measured from the waypoint the ships come from, per direction.  Applies to powered grounding and allision; Category II (missed turn) is unchanged.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="wordWrap">
         <bool>true</bool>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxSquat">
     <property name="title">
      <string>Squat</string>
     </property>
     <property name="toolTip">
      <string>Squat is added to the draught when a model decides which depth areas a ship can ground on: Barras' open-water squat S = Cb x V^2 / 100 (V in knots, S in metres) at the ship's speed on the leg, with the block coefficient Cb from the ship type.  Anchoring and the allision height clearance use the draught without squat.</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayoutSquat">
      <item>
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbSquatDrifting">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Add squat to the draught in drifting grounding</string>
        </property>
        <property name="checked">
         <bool>true</bool>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item>
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbSquatPowered">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Add squat to the draught in powered grounding</string>
        </property>
        <property name="checked">
         <bool>true</bool>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxPassengerReduction">
     <property name="title">
      <string>Passenger ship and fast ferry reduction</string>
     </property>
     <property name="toolTip">
      <string>IWRAP's reduction factor F.  Collisions: the causation factor is divided by the square root of F for every passenger ship or fast ferry in the encounter.  Powered grounding and allision: their frequency is divided by F.  Default 20, as in IWRAP; 1 = no reduction.  Exported to and imported from IWRAP as set.</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="formLayoutPassengerReduction">
      <item row="0" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelPassengerReduction">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Passenger ships</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="0" column="1">
       <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="sbPassengerReduction">
        <property name="decimals">
         <number>1</number>
        </property>
        <property name="minimum">
         <double>1.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <double>1000.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <double>20.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelFastFerryReduction">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Fast ferries (high speed craft)</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="1">
       <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="sbFastFerryReduction">
        <property name="decimals">
